{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_20","type":"agent_message","text":"The focused cleanup tests pass. I found three remaining gaps: Windows uses a no-op cleanup helper; directory enumeration reads every name before checking the entry budget; and a directory moved away before the first open can leave cleanup falsely confirmed. The new FIFO test exercises that last window but discards the cleanup error.\n"}}
